# a 2px stroke is sharp; curves and diagonals are smooth. Toolbar actions sit
# in a 14px box (24px icons, in 30px buttons); files and places fill a 20px box
# at 24px (list rows) and a 16px box at 16px. At 64px (icon view) the 16px
# drawing is four times larger and the stroke stays 2px. Anything not drawn
# here comes from Adwaita.
